<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>مسجد السنة | منصة تعليمية وصدقات</title>
  <meta name="description" content="مسجد السنة - تسجيل الحلقات، المسبحة الرقمية، والصدقات الجارية" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@200;300;400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a1a14;
      --bg-2: #0e241d;
      --panel: #122d25;
      --panel-2: #18372e;
      --primary: #0f7a4f;
      --primary-2: #18a561;
      --gold: #d9b242;
      --gold-2: #f1d77a;
      --text: #ecf4f0;
      --muted: #b9c7c1;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      --success: #34c759;
      --danger: #ff5a5f;
      --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #071711 0%, #0e1f19 30%, #0d2c24 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    img { max-width: 100%; }

    .container {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .btn {
      appearance: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.4rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-2) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(15,122,79,0.28);
    }

    .btn-gold {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--gold-2) 100%);
      color: #122;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(217,178,66,0.22);
    }

    .btn-white {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }

    .btn-danger {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5a5f 0%, #d0312d 100%);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .nav-wrap {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      background: rgba(10,26,20,0.78);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      min-height: 74px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217,178,66,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.06));
      border: 1px solid rgba(217,178,66,0.3);
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      position: relative;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .nav-links a::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      right: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-2));
      transition: width 0.25s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 72px 0 60px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,122,79,0.88), rgba(8,29,22,0.86)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512632578888-169bbbc64f33?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 440px;
      height: 440px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 50%;
      top: -110px;
      right: -80px;
      filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      padding: 30px 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      color: var(--gold-2);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .hero-copy p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      max-width: 620px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .stats-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    .mini-stat {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .mini-stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .mini-stat span {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: rgba(9, 21, 17, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .hero-card .label {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .prayer-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .prayer-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    }

    .prayer-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    section {
      padding: 90px 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: var(--gold-2);
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 700px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,45,37,0.8), rgba(13,27,22,0.9));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: rgba(217,178,66,0.3);
    }

    .card-emoji {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217,178,66,0.18), rgba(15,122,79,0.22));
      border: 1px solid rgba(217,178,66,0.22);
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .register-wrap {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,45,37,0.75), rgba(11,24,20,0.9));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .register-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .field {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .field label {
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .field input,
    .field select,
    .field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      background: rgba(5,15,12,0.5);
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: border 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .field input:focus,
    .field select:focus,
    .field textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(217,178,66,0.12);
    }

    textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; }

    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .message.success {
      display: block;
      background: rgba(52,199,89,0.12);
      color: #8affb0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(52,199,89,0.25);
    }

    .message.error {
      display: block;
      background: rgba(255,90,95,0.12);
      color: #ffb4b6;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,90,95,0.25);
    }

    .counter-box {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 10px 0;
    }

    .counter-box .count {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(217,178,66,0.18);
      margin: 10px 0 20px;
    }

    .counter-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .donation-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .donation-panel,
    .bank-box {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,45,37,0.78), rgba(11,24,20,0.9));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 26px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .bank-box .item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .bank-box .item .label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .bank-box .item .value {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      word-break: break-word;
      direction: ltr;
    }

    .stats-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 24px 0 0;
    }

    .stat-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,122,79,0.96), rgba(24,165,97,0.74));
      padding: 22px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .stat-box strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .stat-box span {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    }

    .prayer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .prayer-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15,122,79,0.85), rgba(19,65,51,0.9));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .prayer-box .name {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .prayer-box .time {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--gold-2);
    }

    .footer {
      background: rgba(4, 12, 10, 0.8);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 28px 0 60px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .footer .top-line {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      color: var(--gold-2);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .wa-float {
      position: fixed;
      left: 22px;
      bottom: 22px;
      width: 62px;
      height: 62px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25d366 0%, #18ab4d 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(37,211,102,0.38);
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(3, 11, 9, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
      z-index: 200;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .modal.show { display: flex; }

    .modal-card {
      width: min(700px, 100%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,45,37,0.98), rgba(12,22,18,0.98));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }

    .modal-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .close-btn {
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 2rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .admin-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .list-item {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .list-item small {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .list-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .empty-note {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 26px 10px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero-grid, .donation-grid, .cards, .register-grid, .prayer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .stats-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 12px 0 18px;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 28px;
      }

      .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }

      .wa-float { width: 56px; height: 56px; left: 16px; bottom: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="مسجد السنة">
          <span class="brand-mark">🕌</span>
          <span>مسجد السنة</span>
        </a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#about">عن المسجد</a>
          <a href="#register">التسجيل</a>
          <a href="#tasbih">المسبحة</a>
          <a href="#donations">الصدقات</a>
          <a href="#prayers">مواقيت الصلاة</a>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-white" onclick="openLoginModal()">🔐 دخول الشيخ</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">📍 حي الصحابة • طريق الدعوة الإسلامية</div>
        <h1>مسجد السنة</h1>
        <p>منصة إسلامية متكاملة لتعليم القرآن الكريم، تنظيم الحلقات، متابعة المتعلمين، وتسخير التقنية لخدمة المسجد وأهدافه الخيرية.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scrollToSection('register')">📝 التسجيل في الحلقات</button>
          <button class="btn btn-gold" onclick="openDonationModal()">🤲 تبرع الآن</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stats-box">
          <div class="mini-stat"><strong>+500</strong><span>مشارك</span></div>
          <div class="mini-stat"><strong>12</strong><span>حلقة</span></div>
          <div class="mini-stat"><strong>24/7</strong><span>خدمة</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card">
        <span class="label">مواقيت الصلاة اليوم</span>
        <div class="prayer-card">
          <div class="prayer-row"><span>الفجر</span><strong>05:30</strong></div>
          <div class="prayer-row"><span>الظهر</span><strong>12:45</strong></div>
          <div class="prayer-row"><span>العصر</span><strong>16:00</strong></div>
          <div class="prayer-row"><span>المغرب</span><strong>18:20</strong></div>
          <div class="prayer-row"><span>العشاء</span><strong>19:45</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>ماذا نقدم؟</h2>
          <p>نحو مجتمع إسلامي متدين، متعلم، ومؤثر، من خلال تعليم القرآن، خدمة الحلقات، ونشر ثقافة العطاء والصدقة الجارية.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-emoji">📚</div>
            <h3>تعليم القرآن</h3>
            <p>حلقات حفظ وتجويد القرآن الكريم بأسلوب ميسر وبمستوى يراعي الفروق العمرية والقدرات.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-emoji">🎓</div>
            <h3>دروس شرعية</h3>
            <p>محاضرات في العقيدة، الفقه، والسيرة، مع تنسيق مناسب للطلبة والنساء والأطفال.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-emoji">🤲</div>
            <h3>الصدقات الجارية</h3>
            <p>مساهمة في دعم المسجد وتحسين خدماته وتعزيز أثره في المجتمع من خلال التبرعات.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="register">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>التسجيل في الحلقات</h2>
          <p>ملأ النموذج أدناه، وسيتلقى الشيخ طلبك مباشرة عبر واتساب.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="register-wrap">
          <form id="regForm">
            <div class="register-grid">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="studentName">اسم الطالب الثلاثي</label>
                <input id="studentName" type="text" placeholder="أحمد محمد علي" required />
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="parentPhone">هاتف ولي الأمر</label>
                <input id="parentPhone" type="tel" placeholder="2189XXXXXXXX" required />
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="readType">الرواية</label>
                <select id="readType" required>
                  <option value="">اختر الرواية</option>
                  <option>حفص عن عاصم</option>
                  <option>قالون عن نافع</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="timeSlot">الفترة المفضلة</label>
                <select id="timeSlot" required>
                  <option value="">اختر الفترة</option>
                  <option>بعد الفجر</option>
                  <option>بعد العصر</option>
                  <option>بعد المغرب</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field" style="margin-top: 22px;">
              <label for="notes">ملاحظات إضافية</label>
              <textarea id="notes" placeholder="أي ملاحظات أو احتياجات خاصة؟"></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary submit-btn">✅ إرسال الطلب للشيخ</button>
